OL,3,GNEWSAStab murder accused says he       
OL,4,A'struck out' in panic                  
OL,6,FA 15-year-old boy accused of murdering 
OL,7,Fanother teenager with a knife told his 
OL,8,Ftrial he was "scared" and "panicked" at
OL,9,Fthe time of the stabbing.              
OL,11,FThe boy, who cannot be named for legal 
OL,12,Freasons, is accused of killing         
OL,13,F16-year-old Baye Bireme Fall, known as 
OL,14,FBB, in Peterborough on 12 April.       
OL,16,FThe defendant and Emidas Krutkevicius, 
OL,17,F18, of Garton End Road, Peterborough,  
OL,18,Fboth deny murdering BB in a            
OL,19,Fconfrontation near the Ortongate       
OL,20,FShopping Centre.                       
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
