OL,3,GNEWSAStab murder accused says he       
OL,4,A'struck out' in panic                  
OL,6,FSpeaking at the city's crown court on  
OL,7,FThursday, the boy said he "struck out, 
OL,8,Ffearing for my friend's life".         
